# SyOS flatpak manifest - one application id per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# Policy is apt-first (design doc 4.7); flatpak is the fallback for apps
# Debian does not ship or ships too old. bootstrap.sh installs flatpak itself
# only when this file has an entry in it, so an empty list costs nothing.
#
# Obsidian was here and was removed: a third-party notes app in its own world,
# with its own vault concept and its own idea of what an interface looks like,
# is a foreign body in a system whose whole point is one coherent frame.
# See docs/decisions.md.
#
# Example:
# us.zoom.Zoom
